#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:21
msgid "PB-02开发板可以在arduino IDE开发吗？"
msgstr "Can the PB-02 development board be developed in Arduino IDE?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:22
#: be509545037c4bd58ed2d715ab4a71c7
msgid "不行哦，这个是使用keil5进行开发的"
msgstr "No. It is developed using Keil5."

#: 07373e24fe054fc38a0da4daa37a436c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:25
msgid "PB-02模块usb供电吗"
msgstr "Can the PB-02 module be powered via USB?"

#: 7064a932b07e437685801318e8b29aa3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:26
msgid "USB既可以供电也可以当串口使用"
msgstr "USB can be used both for power supply and as a serial port."

#: 25b9d7be424a43368199161ef2e3ad75
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:29
msgid "PB-02这个模组可以用jtag下载吗"
msgstr "Can the PB-02 module be downloaded via JTAG?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:30
#: b9d7963b76ef4bb8a88bc1a798580eed
msgid "不支持，它是通过串口下载的"
msgstr "No. It is downloaded through the serial port."

#: 990c16a427e546089f400a5be2863d36
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:33
msgid "PB-01开发板做照明等中心主机用？"
msgstr ""
"Can the PB-01 development board be used as a central host for lighting "
"applications?"

#: 3ae2937089f441288f2220118c3c092c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:34
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:177
#: b6ba8b63bfdc4681a2ef712a707fc774
msgid "可以的"
msgstr "Yes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:37
#: bc1301693a784d12ba11f53708a7c357
msgid "PB-02模组供电后是不是就可以工作了？就可以通过蓝牙设备搜索到模组了吗？"
msgstr ""
"After powering on the PB-02 module, can it work directly? Can it be found"
" by Bluetooth devices?"

#: 676b43bed2214ebdb2403d1f953ee1af
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:38
#, python-format
msgid ""
"供电后就能搜到蓝牙信号，`参考资料 "
"<https://blog.csdn.net/Boantong%5F/article/details/109474628>`__"
msgstr ""
"After power-on, the Bluetooth signal can be found. "
"https://blog.csdn.net/Boantong%5F/article/details/109474628"

#: 11f7e1992a394bc5a084f90c6998b061
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:41
msgid "TB系列与PB系列在软件上能否兼容使用？"
msgstr "Are the TB series and PB series software-compatible?"

#: 774ad9eb44434c23aa4a5a354d150f9f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:42
msgid "程序不兼容，但是BLE测试软件可以使用同一个"
msgstr ""
"The programs are not compatible, but the BLE test software can be the "
"same."

#: 5b6f387268b64a799b5b428d00546644
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:45
msgid "TB系列模组中SIGMESH协议跟私有MESH协议有什么区别？"
msgstr ""
"What is the difference between the SIG Mesh protocol and the private MESH"
" protocol in TB series modules?"

#: 2a1bd2a339644dc39295c94041b84e0c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:46
msgid "SIGMESH协议的特点就是协议统一，所有采用SIGMESH协议的设备都采用了其中一套协议。而私有MESH则是协议独立。"
msgstr ""
"The characteristic of the SIG Mesh protocol is that the protocol is "
"unified; all devices using the SIG Mesh protocol adopt the same protocol "
"set. A private Mesh protocol is independent."

#: 300c62e0d1ce4cf4b893130cbafd7962
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:50
msgid "PB-03F模组一包数据最大支持大多？"
msgstr "What is the maximum size of one packet supported by the PB-03F module?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:51
#: d4d37537d9a04e7da89173d83c8b6507
msgid "TB/PB系列模组一包数据的大小由MTU参数决定，最大支持254B。"
msgstr ""
"The size of one packet for TB/PB series modules is determined by the MTU "
"parameter, with a maximum support of 254 bytes."

#: 3e00e0fbfb6b4b48b20a3c57e2f3ec9f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:54
msgid "PB01/02模组连接天猫精灵在设置三元组有哪些注意的地方"
msgstr ""
"What should be noted when setting the triplet for connecting PB01/02 "
"modules to Tmall Genie?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:55
#: a9f2e7c524774a788e3e3dffbe2dc17f
msgid "设备ID需要通过在线转换工具将十进制转换成十六进制并在前面补00凑够8个字节长度"
msgstr ""
"The device ID needs to be converted from decimal to hexadecimal using an "
"online conversion tool, and prefixed with 00 to make it 8 bytes long."

#: 2c56479a90274e36ba17977768eefeec
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:58
msgid "蓝牙调试助手可以给TB-02开发板发送AT指令控制IO口的电平吗"
msgstr ""
"Can the Bluetooth debugging assistant send AT commands to the TB-02 "
"development board to control the IO pin level?"

#: 7564611e56d240c8a2f8e8a271d220df
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:59
msgid "出厂AT固件不支持，需要对AT固件做二次开发实现"
msgstr ""
"The factory AT firmware does not support this. Secondary development of "
"the AT firmware is required."

#: 823b8b4d39fa410abf7ca8da795e3ee2
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:62
msgid "PB-03F模组支持BLE5.0么？"
msgstr "Does the PB-03F module support BLE 5.0?"

#: 134d148a598241d5ae8d0ceb128bc4c3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:63
msgid "支持，PB-03系列模组支持BLE5.2，该协议向下兼容；"
msgstr ""
"Yes. The PB-03 series modules support BLE 5.2, and the protocol is "
"backward compatible."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:66
#: d8fb3b19240047f29aa16f5659ba4782
msgid "如何实现手机控制TB-02的LED开关？"
msgstr "How can a mobile phone control the LED switch of TB-02?"

#: 952275dc3e6445aa8168be11daf82412
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:67
msgid "调用GPIO相关指令即可操作LED等的开关状态。"
msgstr "Call GPIO-related commands to control the on/off state of LEDs and others."

#: 8f78742088b64f85991c90767d5fa030
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:70
msgid "PB-02能传音乐吗"
msgstr "Can PB-02 transmit music?"

#: 4dc0afb7123f44948483f8bb299825fe
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:71
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:273
#: dfb6eb4813364a7fb1753f502c2a66ac
msgid "不能，该蓝牙没有音频芯片"
msgstr "No. This Bluetooth module does not have an audio chip."

#: 4ed4470fe72d44479a307735b919907f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:74
msgid "PB03出厂默认AT固件最长能设置蓝牙广播名称为多少个字节"
msgstr ""
"What is the maximum Bluetooth advertising name length supported by the "
"default factory AT firmware of PB-03?"

#: 7a7aa166d35d4d66b7af505d64e7cbc0
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:75
msgid "12个字节"
msgstr "12 bytes."

#: 49d9d1bfd3ff42488f57e57d66491004
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:78
msgid "PB-01、02如何对接天猫精灵"
msgstr "How do PB-01 and PB-02 connect to Tmall Genie?"

#: 22af307dd07e436b8222ab7137cc1386
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:79
msgid "烧写支持对接天猫精灵固件并通过指令设置天猫精灵平台提供的三元组"
msgstr ""
"Flash the firmware that supports Tmall Genie integration, and set the "
"triplet provided by the Tmall Genie platform through commands."

#: 3e055b1aaa9846bfacbae5647317731f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:82
msgid "PB01如何外接带IPEX座子的天线"
msgstr "How can PB01 connect to an external antenna with an IPEX connector?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:83
#: d27bb23a05834907b7412e863f822aaa
msgid "默认天线采用半孔焊盘方式，可以在主板上设计一个IPEX端口方便进行外接"
msgstr ""
"By default, the antenna uses a castellated solder pad design. You can "
"design an IPEX port on the mainboard for external antenna connection."

#: 8929dad5ac3a4348a062a78f57b44633
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:87
msgid "PB系列的SDK代码用什么开发平台"
msgstr "What development platform is used for the PB series SDK code?"

#: 91400a9870de4a5188ee148012e19430
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:88
msgid "keil5"
msgstr "Keil5."

#: 1fe03dfdd0bb43a4b1c10d4e100d7efd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:91
msgid "PB-03F模块的信号强度与通信距离能到多少"
msgstr ""
"What are the signal strength and communication distance of the PB-03F "
"module?"

#: 686120be40374f4986cbb2019583f54b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:92
msgid "信号强度10dbm，通讯距离空旷环境100米左右"
msgstr ""
"The signal strength is 10dBm, and the communication distance is about "
"100m in an open environment."

#: 8a1dcf2c4d6f4329bd88ad070cc00c5f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:95
msgid "PB-03F自带32.768K晶振吗"
msgstr "Does PB-03F have a built-in 32.768 kHz crystal?"

#: 55b22cf4bb2440d99fc44ecffa20ac70
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:96
msgid "内部芯片自带"
msgstr "It is built into the internal chip."

#: 3a70767e459244d08d49dc78d9614927
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:99
msgid "TB-02的复位引脚是高电平复位还是低电平"
msgstr "Is the reset pin of TB-02 active-high or active-low?"

#: 1bdef93be4c0489b87f2487e8746b12b 5af0729cc18642b8b3909136856669e4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:100
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:165
msgid "低电平复位"
msgstr "Active-low reset."

#: 479ff3f397294ad7b388d5256fe0a0be
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:103
msgid "TB/PB系列模组能否支持SIG_MESH_1.0.1版本"
msgstr "Can TB/PB series modules support SIG_Mesh_1.0.1?"

#: 44dfa83ca9694ba791f4f6b27c86ce72
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:104
msgid "可以支持。"
msgstr "Yes."

#: 7e66b242d9264d97bb3f718d9ce46a6a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:107
msgid "PB-03M模组能否贴片焊接"
msgstr "Can the PB-03M module be mounted by SMT soldering?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:108
#: ddad93ff4aba4a21a9a1361ab5ab1bdc
msgid "可以贴片焊接。"
msgstr "Yes, it supports SMT soldering."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:112
#: c38fcd8de02845c9961fc08b7d155683
msgid "BLE模块哪款支持自组网"
msgstr "Which BLE module supports self-organizing networking?"

#: 4ba49eb5bba64d50be4e857455c9c68a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:113
msgid "TB系列模组，需要跑私有MESH协议"
msgstr "TB series modules, running a private Mesh protocol."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:116
#: fee673efc02d4b60af81e92298d51620
msgid "PB02模组出厂AT固件支持对接天猫精灵吗"
msgstr ""
"Does the factory AT firmware of the PB-02 module support Tmall Genie "
"integration?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:117
#: fb56cbf8af0e410c93059f2c25299676
msgid "不支持，需要通过串口重新烧写天猫精灵固件"
msgstr "No. The Tmall Genie firmware must be re-flashed through the serial port."

#: 2991793d3c23485c9e4d287697a522d6
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:120
msgid "PB-03模组有内部分32.768k晶振么？"
msgstr "Does the PB-03 module have an internal 32.768 kHz crystal?"

#: 8de58b5e18424f2988beba5b15de872a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:121
msgid "有的"
msgstr "Yes."

#: 25dea1c421224f4a8cc64a2f5657689f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:124
msgid "PB-03可以实现蓝牙透传么？"
msgstr "Can PB-03 implement Bluetooth transparent transmission?"

#: 0f9b7de68e594abd8807e3aa501d3afa
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:125
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:189
#: a12acaaaa0284eeeb9f5a9ed35902d5b
msgid "可以"
msgstr "Yes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:128
#: a10cbfa36675405188abfd1638417890
msgid "PB-01模组能否在没有网关的情况下实现mesh自组网？"
msgstr ""
"Can the PB-01 module implement Mesh self-organizing networking without a "
"gateway?"

#: 042400ab9fd94b9dac8323b4ba9785b4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:129
msgid "不可以，节点的数据需要网关上传"
msgstr "No. Node data needs to be uploaded through a gateway."

#: 813ffef8b02b4cd4a4e1564008eb13fe
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:132
msgid "TB-02模组的MASH组网SDK开源么"
msgstr "Is the Mesh networking SDK of the TB-02 module open source?"

#: 0f0d05f33d6a494eb1c3e6e90a851dd6
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:133
msgid "开源的，SDK仓库链接为：https://github.com/Ai-Thinker-Open/Telink_SIG_Mesh"
msgstr ""
"Yes. The SDK repository link is: https://github.com/Ai-Thinker-"
"Open/Telink_SIG_Mesh"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:136
#: a8b635e23cbf4f3eb4c6f830c28a2ffe
msgid "TB-03F V8固件，V9固件和AT MESH固件有啥区别"
msgstr ""
"What are the differences between TB-03F V8 firmware, V9 firmware, and AT "
"Mesh firmware?"

#: 89a673ac704e4f83a9426a508045e122
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:137
msgid "V8 V9固件为AT基本功能固件，不具备MESH功能；AT MESH固件支持组网通信"
msgstr ""
"V8 and V9 firmware are AT basic-function firmware and do not have Mesh "
"functionality. AT Mesh firmware supports networking communication."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:140
#: cecf2077ff144ea99ebbca52e8080104
msgid "PB-03能否能实现透传么"
msgstr "Can PB-03 implement transparent transmission?"

#: 6e63a9d274a64119ba127650396e0606
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:141
msgid "该模组具有透传功能，详情参考说明文档。该模组支持二次开发，详情访问我司官方DOCS系统。"
msgstr ""
"This module has transparent transmission functionality. For details, "
"refer to the user manual. The module supports secondary development. For "
"details, visit our official DOCS system."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:144
#: cf9721fa4df34db4b5ad01254e0190e4
msgid "请问下PB-03可以二次开发么，用的哪一个开发环境呢？"
msgstr "Can PB-03 be secondarily developed? Which development environment is used?"

#: 98f89e45fa5a4f248a506faf29f151b1
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:145
msgid "支持二次开发，用的开发环境是keil MDK。"
msgstr ""
"Yes, it supports secondary development. The development environment is "
"Keil MDK."

#: 4f9ffc3357a74b0186ca11139f903509
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:148
msgid "TB-04模组能否与其他蓝牙设备进行通讯？"
msgstr "Can the TB-04 module communicate with other Bluetooth devices?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:149
#: d6884eddc8244d7eb37f5c41a3a71b06
msgid "通过二次开发可以实现；"
msgstr "This can be implemented through secondary development."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:152
#: fc1aabd597844721865299cb9064dbc0
msgid "TB系列模块天猫和小米的音响都支持吗"
msgstr "Do TB series modules support both Tmall Genie and Xiaomi speakers?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:153
#: f8ba3d02402040c5afa80455dbcecb3e
msgid "目前仅支持天猫精灵音响"
msgstr "Currently, only Tmall Genie speakers are supported."

#: 10a1562db83f49a3bdcf81e35eea718b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:156
msgid "请问一下PB-03F的RX0、TX0串口电平是TTL还是232？"
msgstr "Are the RX0 and TX0 serial port levels of PB-03F TTL or RS232?"

#: 146790faec4a415ba7d1d5764ae1865d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:157
msgid "是TTL电平"
msgstr "They are TTL levels."

#: 7afdb80a143641aa9caf21c9e0e3868e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:160
msgid "TB/PB系列模块可以跟电脑通信吗"
msgstr "Can TB/PB series modules communicate with a computer?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:161
#: f12ce03c1041433d8980dc02f9c3486b
msgid "可以，不过需要购买专门的蓝牙适配器进行调试"
msgstr ""
"Yes, but a dedicated Bluetooth adapter needs to be purchased for "
"debugging."

#: 5d35a6eece024070956ac59994010375
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:164
msgid "PB-02模组上的RST引脚复位是高电平还是低电平"
msgstr "Is the RST pin reset of the PB-02 module active-high or active-low?"

#: 1deb3572e9b0425bb8835cf71d8092fc
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:168
msgid "PB-03F模组在烧录固件过程中掉电了，有办法恢复么？"
msgstr ""
"If the PB-03F module loses power during firmware flashing, is there a way"
" to recover it?"

#: 976a0fe28a7649918ef83509f60e5d44
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:169
msgid "重新刷固件即可"
msgstr "Just flash the firmware again."

#: 8faba744bc7644248c16962f62f5b6e4
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:172
msgid "TB系列模组支持OTA升级吗"
msgstr "Do TB series modules support OTA upgrade?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:173
#: dd3120357e4c48e28e226fe8d6532638
msgid "支持，可以通过APP的方式进行升级"
msgstr "Yes, they can be upgraded via an app."

#: 074a1732dc61441089a11e57d5697e4f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:176
msgid "请问一下，PB-03F模组二次开发，GPIO中断能用吗？"
msgstr ""
"For secondary development of the PB-03F module, can GPIO interrupts be "
"used?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:180
#: e22260b150364819a0891b3a7f5f69eb
msgid "你好，请问一下PB-03F模组在刷机的时候掉电了，还能回复吗？"
msgstr ""
"If the PB-03F module loses power during flashing, can it still be "
"recovered?"

#: 76db2768279b476784d1445af6f4d8a0
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:181
msgid "重新刷固件即可；"
msgstr "Just flash the firmware again."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:184
#: ea6c419f9db64f589249e2aa1f943644
msgid "PB系列能否与WB2系列进行蓝牙相互通讯"
msgstr "Can PB series modules communicate with WB2 series modules via Bluetooth?"

#: 9d30081a7dd74bfaa0dc4b6b578aa887
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:185
msgid "可以相互通讯"
msgstr "Yes, they can communicate with each other."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:188
#: a12d498bcace48d6942801be7239b3f1
msgid "PB-03F可以接出IIC接口吗"
msgstr "Can PB-03F expose an IIC interface?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:192
#: cfeeebf2c0e14181af97c2e8292cf47d
msgid "PB-03可以使用vscode软件开发吗"
msgstr "Can PB-03 be developed using VS Code?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/bt/bt.rst:193
#: dcc73d95ddd947e2a7bab61fe71b7353
msgid "可以，在vscode上安装keil插件"
msgstr "Yes. Install the Keil plugin in VS Code."

